<title>PERU: Peru's money base expands 1.0 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Peru's money base expands 1.0 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base expanded 1.0 percent during February to stand at 3.747 billion soles at the end of the month, the Central Reserve Bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The money base ended last year at 3.996, up from 3.658 billion soles at the start of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
